{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Process this lead information and save it to our CRM:\n\nHey, I just got off the phone with a potential client. Here are the details:\n\nHis name is John Smith and he works as VP of Engineering at TechCorp Industries.\nThey're based in San Francisco, California, USA. You can reach him at\njohn.smith@techcorp.io or call him at +1-555-0123.\n\nHe's interested in our enterprise plan and wants a demo next week.\n\nSteps:\n1. Extract the lead information into structured format using 'lead' schema\n2. Store the extracted data as 'current_lead' in metadata\n3. Call create_lead API with the metadata key 'current_lead'\n\nReport back when complete."},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_9FqllL4y8hSF3xo1dtcDoPS3","type":"function","function":{"name":"structured_output","arguments":"{\"input\":\"Hey, I just got off the phone with a potential client. Here are the details:\\n\\nHis name is John Smith and he works as VP of Engineering at TechCorp Industries.\\nThey're based in San Francisco, California, USA. You can reach him at\\njohn.smith@techcorp.io or call him at +1-555-0123.\\n\\nHe's interested in our enterprise plan and wants a demo next week.\",\"schema\":\"lead\",\"store_as\":\"current_lead\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_9FqllL4y8hSF3xo1dtcDoPS3","content":"Extracted lead (stored as 'current_lead'): {\"name\":\"John Smith\",\"email\":\"john.smith@techcorp.io\",\"company\":\"TechCorp Industries\",\"phone\":\"+1-555-0123\",\"role\":\"VP of Engineering\",\"address\":null,\"city\":\"San Francisco\",\"country\":\"USA\"}"}],"parallel_tool_calls":false,"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"structured_output","description":"Extract structured data from unstructured text using a predefined schema.\n\nThe extraction uses AI to parse the input and populate a validated data structure.\nIf extraction fails validation, the system will retry automatically.\n\nUse 'store_as' parameter to save the extracted data in agent metadata for use by other tools.\n\n\nAvailable schemas:\n- lead: Business lead with contact information","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"input":{"type":"string","description":"The unstructured text to extract data from"},"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the schema to extract into","enum":["lead"]},"store_as":{"type":"string","description":"Optional: metadata key to store the extracted data for use by other tools"}},"required":["input","schema"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"store_metadata","description":"Store a value in agent metadata for use by other tools.\n\nUse this to pass data between tool calls. For example:\n1. Extract data and store: store_metadata(key: \"current_lead\", value: {\"name\": \"John\", \"email\": \"john@example.com\"})\n2. Later tool reads it: save_lead(metadata_key: \"current_lead\")\n\nKeys should be descriptive: \"current_lead\", \"extracted_contacts\", \"scraped_content\", etc.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"key":{"type":"string","description":"Unique identifier for this data (e.g., \"current_lead\", \"scraped_content\")"},"value":{"description":"The data to store. Can be any JSON-serializable value: string, number, object, array."}},"required":["key","value"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"read_metadata","description":"Read a value from agent metadata that was previously stored.\n\nUse this to inspect data stored by previous tool calls.\nReturns the value as JSON, or an error if the key doesn't exist.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"key":{"type":"string","description":"The key to read from metadata"}},"required":["key"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"list_metadata","description":"List all keys currently stored in agent metadata.\n\nReturns a list of available keys with their value types.\nUse this to see what data has been stored by previous tool calls.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{},"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"create_lead","description":"Creates a new lead in the CRM system using data from agent metadata.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"metadata_key":{"type":"string","description":"The metadata key where lead data is stored (e.g., \"current_lead\")"}},"required":["metadata_key"]}}}],"tool_choice":"auto","reasoning_effort":"none"}